OL,3,GNEWSAEx-football boss's relief after
OL,4,Ainvestigation dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into a former
OL,7,FMacclesfield FC boss has been dropped,
OL,8,Fpolice have confirmed.
OL,10,FRobert Smethurst was arrested in
OL,11,FWilmslow, Cheshire, on 19 May on
OL,12,Fsuspicion of controlling and coercive
OL,13,Fbehaviour.
OL,15,FCheshire Police said the former
OL,16,Fco-owner of the National League North
OL,17,Fclub had since been released without
OL,18,Ffurther action "due to insufficient
OL,19,Fevidence" following "a thorough
OL,20,Finvestigation".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
